  uniform-range trees of arbitrary depth (scope pinned by `borrowTreeWorldRel_scope`; `BorrowTreeWorldRel`
  with inductive SIFA soundness `SifaSoundFor`, discharging `ProtectorReleaseSim` for real implicit
