/-- Choice-free `[T; N]` `Sized` fast-path (`lean-miri#79`), Unicode scalar
`ScalarInt.toChar` (`lean-miri#82`), and wide-`dyn` precedence canary:
1. `[u8; usize::MAX]` is syntactically `Sized` and passes `validateRawPtrFastPath`
